# Add files here to ignore them from prettier formatting
/dist
/coverage
/.nx/cache
/.nx/workspace-data
/test-workspace/coverage

# Angular component templates.
#
# Prettier 2 predates Angular's built-in control flow: it parses `@if` / `@for`
# / `@switch` as ordinary text and reflows the blocks into flat runs, which
# turns a nested template into something markedly harder to read than what the
# author wrote. Formatting them badly is worse than not formatting them, so
# they stay as authored until the workspace moves to Prettier 3, which
# understands the syntax.
*.component.html
